\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Christ is coming! Let creation
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 From her groans and travail cease;
\par Let the glorious proclamation
\par Hope restore and faith increase.
\par Christ is coming!
\par Come, Thou blessed Prince of Peace.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Earth can now but tell the story
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Of Thy bitter Cross and pain;
\par  She shall yet behold Thy glory;
\par  When Thou comest back to reign;
\par  Christ is Coming!
\par  Let each heart repeat the strain.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.   Long Thine exiles have been pining;
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  Far from rest, and home, and Thee;
\par  But in heavenly vestures shining,
\par   They their loving Lord shall see:
\par  Christ is Coming!
\par  Haste the joyous jubilee.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-270\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  4.   With that blessed hope before us,
\par \pard\li270\sl190\slmult0  Let no harp remain unstrung;
\par  Let the mighty advent chorus
\par  Onward roll from tongue to tongue;
\par  Christ is Coming!
\par \pard        Come, Lord Jesus, quickly come!\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

